{"step_index":254,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:24:04Z","thinking":"**Updating the Walkthrough**\n\nI'm currently focused on the `walkthrough.md` file. I'm adding the latest features to the documentation. I've got swipe gestures on the lead contact card in the works, allowing for dialing and skipping. Plus, I'm documenting the 100% offline text and regex extractor, and the new smart callback scheduling.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Updated Walkthrough covering the 3 immediate elevation upgrades: Swipe Gesture Controls, 100% Offline Unstructured Text Extractor, and Smart Callback Follow-up Scheduling.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: \\\"Snap-to-Dial\\\" Elevation Upgrades\\n\\nThe **SnapDialer** codebase at [`C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer) has been updated with the 3 major elevation features:\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Swipe Gesture Controls ([`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx))\\n- **Fluid PanResponder Gestures on the Contact Card:**\\n  - 👉 **Swipe Right:** Triggers live green `📞 RELEASE TO DIAL` visual and haptic cue $\\\\rightarrow$ dials the contact.\\n  - 👈 **Swipe Left:** Triggers orange `⏭️ RELEASE TO SKIP` cue $\\\\rightarrow$ skips to the next contact.\\n  - Smooth spring-back physics if released before the threshold.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. 100% Offline Unstructured Text & Document Extractor ([`src/services/visionService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts))\\n- **`VisionService.parseUnstructuredText`:**\\n  - Zero-internet, zero-API-key on-device extraction pipeline.\\n  - Parses raw copied text from emails, CRM exports, notes, or OCR text dumps using intelligent regex and telephone tokenization.\\n  - Accessible via the new **\\\"Paste Text / CSV (100% Offline)\\\"** button in [`ScanSheetScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Smart Callback Scheduling & Follow-Up Carousel ([`src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx) & [`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx))\\n- **1-Tap Callback Scheduler in Dialer HUD:**\\n  - ⏱️ *In 2 Hours*\\n  - 🌅 *Tomorrow at 10:00 AM*\\n  - 📅 *In 2 Days*\\n  - 📆 *Next Week*\\n- **Persistent SQLite Storage:** Stores `follow_up_at` and reminder notes.\\n- **Home Screen Follow-Up Carousel:** Automatically surfac\n<truncated 379 bytes>","Description":"\"Walkthrough detailing swipe gestures, offline text extractor, and follow-up scheduler\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Updating walkthrough artifact\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md with new features\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
