{"step_index":256,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:24:09Z","content":"All 3 immediate elevation features have been built and integrated into the project:\n\n---\n\n### What Was Implemented:\n\n1. **Fluid Swipe Gesture Controls ([`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx)):**\n   - Built with React Native's native `PanResponder` and `Animated` physics:\n     - 👉 **Swipe Right on Contact Card:** Shows a live `📞 RELEASE TO DIAL` visual badge $\\rightarrow$ triggers outbound dialing on release.\n     - 👈 **Swipe Left on Contact Card:** Shows a live `⏭️ RELEASE TO SKIP` badge $\\rightarrow$ advances to the next contact.\n     - Smooth spring-back physics if released before the threshold.\n\n2. **100% Offline Unstructured Text & Document Extractor ([`src/services/visionService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts)):**\n   - `VisionService.parseUnstructuredText`: Runs entirely on-device with **zero internet connection and zero API keys required**.\n   - Uses multi-pattern regex to isolate telephone numbers, names, and emails from unstructured clipboard text, emails, or OCR text dumps.\n   - Accessible via the new **\"Paste Text / CSV (100% Offline)\"** button in [`ScanSheetScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx).\n\n3. **Smart Callback Follow-Up Scheduling & Home Screen Carousel ([`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx) & [`src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **HUD Callback Scheduler:** 1-tap presets to schedule reminders (*⏱️ In 2 Hours, 🌅 Tomorrow 10 AM, 📅 In 2 Days, 📆 Next Week*).\n   - **Persistent Storage:** Stored in SQLite (`follow_up_at` timestamp).\n   - **Home Screen Reminder Carousel:** Automatically renders an urgent horizontal scroll banner of upcoming callbacks at the top of the Home Screen with 1-tap access to that lead's profile.\n\n---\n\n### How to Test:\nRefresh your browser tab at `http://localhost:8081` (or run `npx expo start --web`) to test the new Swipe Gestures, Offline Text Parser, and Smart Callback Scheduler!"}
