{"step_index":258,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:30:15Z","thinking":"**Analyzing the User's Request**\n\nI'm currently dissecting the user's request. My focus is on understanding the requirements for scanning and importing data sheets. I'm taking a close look at the provided examples to discern the structure and relevant data fields for dialing and notation.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI've moved on to solidify the data structures. I'm focusing on the images, parsing each field in detail. My goal is to accurately represent the information in each file. I need to capture the specific needs of the client regarding FRS retirement, alongside the data sheet import functionalities. I am also working on the data field extractions, trying to match fields from both images.\n\n\n**Extracting Specific Details**\n\nI'm now extracting key details from this section. I see an email address, the number of years working in the Florida Retirement System, and the user's self-assessment of their FRS knowledge. I'm also noting the checked options indicating their interest in learning more, a guaranteed interest plan, and better understanding their current savings. I'm taking this data as user input to assist with the next step.\n\n\n**Defining Meeting Preferences**\n\nI'm now concentrating on the meeting preference data. I've extracted the structured format for specifying availability, including the day and time ranges. I recognize this as a key component for scheduling and am eager to integrate this into the workflow. I need to handle this information for the user for quick reference, but I also need to make it visible, and editable.\n\n\n**Interpreting User Interests**\n\nI'm now diving into the user's interests as expressed through checkboxes and knowledge level. Specifically, I'm parsing the array of strings indicating various FRS-related interests, as well as the string for custom questions. I will leverage this information to tailor the interactions. Additionally, I'm examining their stated FRS knowledge level to adjust my approach.\n\n\n**Visualizing Key Data**\n\nI'm now visualizing how the HUD screen will look when an agent connects with Joseph Adona. I have the school, FRS data, interests, and availability, and I'm crafting the SMS template for auto-personalization. It will be for ValuTeachers and FRS.\nI need to customize the entire application. I'm exploring the implementation requirements.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Implementation plan to customize SnapDialer specifically for ValuTeachers & Florida Retirement System (FRS) cards, including full schema extraction for FRS knowledge level, DROP interests, 403(b)/457(b) contributions, meeting time preferences, and tailored ValuTeachers HUD & SMS templates.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# ValuTeachers & Florida Retirement System (FRS) Customization Plan\\n\\nTransform SnapDialer into a specialized **ValuTeachers & FRS Retirement Prospecting Power App**, tailor-made for scanning **ValuTeachers Report Cards** and **National Life Group / ValuTeachers Free Retirement Analysis Cards**.\\n\\n## User Review Required\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> The app is now strictly tailored to ValuTeachers & FRS educators. The AI Vision Engine, SQLite schema, Dialer HUD, and SMS Templates will now automatically extract, store, and present all specific educator fields:\\n> - **Educator Details:** School, Room #, Planning Period, FRS Years of Service, Age / DOB, Salary, Paychecks/Yr, Text Ok (Y/N).\\n> - **FRS Knowledge Level:** (e.g. *Not very much*, *I know a little*, *Very well*).\\n> - **Specific FRS & 403(b) Interests:** D.R.O.P., 403(b)/457(b) annuities, Guaranteed interest + 5% bonus, Permanent life insurance, State pension analysis, Rollovers.\\n> - **Educator's Questions:** \\\"I have a question about: ...\\\"\\n> - **Best Meeting Availability (1st, 2nd, 3rd choices):** (e.g. *1. Mon 1-2 PM, 2. Wed 1-2 PM, 3. Fri 1-2 PM*).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Proposed Changes\\n\\n### 1. Data Layer & Types\\n#### [MODIFY] [`src/types/index.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/types/index.ts)\\n- Add ValuTeachers / FRS fields to `Lead` and `ExtractedLeadItem`:\\n  - `school`: string\\n  - `age`: string\\n  - `planning_period`: string\\n  - `room_number`: string\\n  - `years_in_frs`: string\\n  - `text_ok`: boolean\\n  - `frs_knowledge`: string ('Not very much' | 'I know a little' | 'Very well')\\n  - `frs_interests`: string[] (e.g. DROP, 403b, Guaranteed 5% bonus, Life insurance)\\n  - `custom_questions`: string\\n  - `meeting_preferences`: string[] (1st, 2nd, 3rd preferred meeting times)\\n  - `annual_salary`: string\\n  - `present_403b_contribution`: string\\n\\n#### [MODIFY] [`src/db/database.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/database.ts)\\n- Update SQLite table definition for `leads` to includ\n<truncated 3822 bytes>","Description":"\"ValuTeachers and Florida Retirement System customization plan\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\\\implementation_plan.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing ValuTeachers implementation plan\"","toolSummary":"\"Write implementation_plan.md for ValuTeachers\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
