{"step_index":270,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:30:57Z","thinking":"**Implementing Database Upgrades**\n\nI'm currently working on upgrading the database file, `src/db/database.ts`. I'm focusing on incorporating native SQLite columns to store data from the ValuTeachers fields. These new columns will include fields like `school`, `age`, `planning_period`, `room_number`, `years_in_frs`, `text_ok`, `frs_knowledge`, and `frs_interests`. The `text_ok` column has a default value of 1.\n\n\n**Adding Data and SMS Templates**\n\nI've added new columns for various ValuTeachers fields: `custom_questions`, `meeting_preferences`, `annual_salary`, `present_403b_contribution`, and `follow_up_at`. I've also implemented pre-seeded SMS templates: `tpl_frs_meeting`, `tpl_frs_planning`, and `tpl_frs_drop`. I've also added the demo lead data for `Joseph Adona` at `VOL` to the database.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import { Platform } from 'react-native';\\n\\nexport interface IDatabase {\\n  execAsync(sql: string): Promise<void>;\\n  getAllAsync<T>(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<T[]>;\\n  getFirstAsync<T>(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<T | null>;\\n  runAsync(sql: string, params?: any[]): Promise<any>;\\n  withTransactionAsync(fn: () => Promise<void>): Promise<void>;\\n}\\n\\n// In-Memory / LocalStorage Web Database Implementation for 100% Web Compatibility\\nclass WebDatabase implements IDatabase {\\n  private lists: any[] = [];\\n  private leads: any[] = [];\\n  private call_logs: any[] = [];\\n  private cadence_rules: any[] = [];\\n  private sms_templates: any[] = [];\\n  private settings: { key: string; value: string }[] = [];\\n\\n  constructor() {\\n    this.loadFromStorage();\\n  }\\n\\n  private loadFromStorage() {\\n    try {\\n      if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.localStorage) {\\n        const saved = localStorage.getItem('snap_dialer_valuteachers_data');\\n        if (saved) {\\n          const parsed = JSON.parse(saved);\\n          this.lists = parsed.lists || [];\\n          this.leads = parsed.leads || [];\\n          this.call_logs = parsed.call_logs || [];\\n          this.cadence_rules = parsed.cadence_rules || [];\\n          this.sms_templates = parsed.sms_templates || [];\\n          this.settings = parsed.settings || [];\\n        }\\n      }\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      console.warn('Web localStorage load failed:', e);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  private saveToStorage() {\\n    try {\\n      if (typeof window !== 'undefined' && window.localStorage) {\\n        localStorage.setItem(\\n          'snap_dialer_valuteachers_data',\\n          JSON.stringify({\\n            lists: this.lists,\\n            leads: this.leads,\\n            call_logs: this.call_logs,\\n            cadence_rules: this.cadence_rules,\\n            sms_templates: this.sms_templates,\\n            settings: this.settings,\\n          })\\n        );\\n      }\\n    } catch (e) {\\n      console.warn('Web localStorage save failed:', e);\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  async execAs\n<truncated 15729 bytes>","Description":"\"Upgraded database.ts with ValuTeachers schema, FRS templates, and Joseph Adona sample data\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\snap-dialer\\\\src\\\\db\\\\database.ts\"","toolAction":"\"Updating database.ts for ValuTeachers\"","toolSummary":"\"Update database.ts with ValuTeachers schema\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
